  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This $5,000 Desk Study Review reviews and assesses the value of the Work Product completed pursuant to the TOR for the Nigeria Shiroro and Egbin Power Plants Technical Assistance (USTDA No. 2006-11037A). The DSR Consultant assesses the value of the Work Product against the TOR and the budget per the Grant Agreement between USTDA and the Grantee, dated June 7, 2006, and recommends the appropriate settlement with the Contractor from USTDA.</narrative>
  </description>
